   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>化验台账中的录入错误与真实超标容易混淆。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>批次化验指标、单位和审核规则。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>定位异常单元格，给出复核原因。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='化验数据链条与错误注入点'><text x='20' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>化验数据四道站：每一站都在「造」错数据</text><g transform='translate(20,42)'><rect width='150' height='44' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='75' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>① 采样</text><text x='75' y='36' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>样品混淆 · 代表性差</text></g><g transform='translate(200,42)'><rect width='150' height='44' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='75' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>② 检测</text><text x='75' y='36' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>仪器漂移 · 标定超期</text></g><g transform='translate(380,42)'><rect width='150' height='44' rx='8' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-opacity='.45'/><text x='75' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>③ 录入（重灾区）</text><text x='75' y='36' font-size='8.5' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>小数点错位 · 单位混用 · 串行</text></g><g transform='translate(560,42)'><rect width='140' height='44' rx='8' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='70' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>④ 审核发布</text><text x='70' y='36' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>人工抽查 &lt; 5% 覆盖</text></g><line x1='170' y1='64' x2='196' y2='64' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><line x1='350' y1='64' x2='376' y2='64' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><line x1='530' y1='64' x2='556' y2='64' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><line x1='630' y1='86' x2='630' y2='140' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.4' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><text x='636' y='118' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>一条错数据混入</text><g transform='translate(20,150)'><rect width='210' height='40' rx='8' fill='#f7e9e6' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='105' y='17' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>日报失真</text><text x='105' y='32' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>收率/质量台账全体污染</text></g><g transform='translate(260,150)'><rect width='210' height='40' rx='8' fill='#f7e9e6' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='105' y='17' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>操作误调</text><text x='105' y='32' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>按假数据动设定值</text></g><g transform='translate(500,150)'><rect width='200' height='40' rx='8' fill='#f7e9e6' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='100' y='17' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>出厂误判</text><text x='100' y='32' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>不合格产品流出 · 客诉索赔</text></g><line x1='230' y1='170' x2='256' y2='170' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><line x1='470' y1='170' x2='496' y2='170' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.3' marker-end='url(#arR4)'/><text x='20' y='222' font-size='9.5' fill='#64748b'>抽查覆盖率 &lt; 5% + 录入错误率约 0.5%：每天上万条数据意味着每天有几十条错数据在系统里「裸奔」</text><defs><marker id='arR4' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
