   "no": 2,
   "en": "INTERVENTION",
   "title": "具体方法、输入与可视化结果",
   "html": "<p><b>算法具体怎样计算：</b>规则层核对单位、指标关系与允许范围；MAD层用中位数及绝对偏差识别偏离同类数据的值。规则冲突和离群提示都需要返回原台账复核。</p><p>输入：批次化验指标、单位和审核规则。程序实际采用知识规则引擎＋MAD稳健离群检测，定位异常单元格，给出复核原因。</p><svg class='service-flow' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 760 148' role='img' aria-label='四步计算路径；高亮为当前步骤'><g font-family='system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif'><path d='M96 49H662' fill='none' stroke='var(--line-2,#c9d7e6)' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M183 49h14l-5-5m5 5l-5 5' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-3,#7890a6)' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='8' y='15' width='174' height='92' rx='11' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='var(--line,#c9d7e6)' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='35' cy='40' r='13' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)' fill-opacity='0.12'/><text x='35' y='45' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='600' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>1</text><text x='95' y='81' text-anchor='middle' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>化验字典核对</text><path d='M373 49h14l-5-5m5 5l-5 5' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-3,#7890a6)' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='198' y='15' width='174' height='92' rx='11' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='var(--line,#c9d7e6)' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='225' cy='40' r='13' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)' fill-opacity='0.12'/><text x='225' y='45' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='600' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>2</text><text x='285' y='81' text-anchor='middle' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>规则审核</text><path d='M563 49h14l-5-5m5 5l-5 5' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-3,#7890a6)' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='388' y='15' width='174' height='92' rx='11' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='var(--line,#c9d7e6)' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='415' cy='40' r='13' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)' fill-opacity='0.12'/><text x='415' y='45' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='600' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>3</text><text x='475' y='81' text-anchor='middle' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>稳健离群复核</text><rect x='578' y='15' width='174' height='92' rx='11' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='var(--line,#c9d7e6)' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='605' cy='40' r='13' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)' fill-opacity='0.12'/><text x='605' y='45' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='600' fill='var(--jade,#2875c7)'>4</text><text x='665' y='81' text-anchor='middle' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#20334b)'>单元格证据追踪</text><text x='10' y='135' font-size='12' fill='var(--ink-3,#60798e)'>按箭头顺序阅读：业务输入 → 实际算法 → 检查对照 → 结果解释</text></g></svg><div class='figcap'><b>方法路径</b><span>知识规则引擎＋MAD稳健离群检测；高亮步骤用于说明数据怎样变成可复核的结果。</span></div><p><b>怎样观察：</b>注入小数点或单位错误，点击单元格查看规则证据，再核对查准率与查全率。</p><p>图中流程是教学实现的计算路径。统计检测、规则推理、机理计算、机器学习与优化搜索按各自实际机制描述，不把它们统一称为深度学习。</p>"
